t6-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in the kitchen is preferable</p><p>Preferred location: near a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t6-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Maximum rent: £<span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t6-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> per month</p><p>Other requests: the accommodation has to be <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t6-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in the daytime</p><p>How did you first hear about us? through a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t6-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_6_1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-official-guide-t6-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3131577-official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_6_2.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-official-guide-t6-l-g2-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sou